  "sourceTitle": "Turkey Burgers with oatmeal crust",
  "sourceText": "Turkey Burgers with oatmeal crust\nBy: Linda Owens\nPublished: Monday, December 21, 2009 - 12:40am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 pound ground turkey\n1 egg\n1/2 cup Form You Fast oatmeal\nSalt and pepper to taste\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Form patties from ground turkey and egg mixture. Press crumbs on the outside of the burgers. Cook in oiled frying pan over medium heat until browned on both sides and fully cooked.",
